:TITLE Tatry Mountains 02 (Lite)
///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////

:SHORT_TEXT_START
Polish / Slovakian mountains - Tatry.

Capture enemy airbases & military bases, destroy refinery!

Made by Soczkien
DEC 2017

:TEXT_END

:CAMPAIGN_DATA
